@id falling
@title Falling
@artist Harry Styles
@key C
@capo 4
@tempo 110
@time 4/4
@version Capo 4 arrangement
@strumming Fingerstyle / arpeggio

// Song-level technique guide. LH: 1 index, 2 middle, 3 ring, 4 little. RH: p thumb, i index, m middle, a ring.
@fingering C — part 1
notes: A3 G0 A3 B1
lh: 3 - 3 1
rh: p i p m
used: Intro, Verse/Chorus part 1
@endfingering

@fingering C — part 2
notes: A3 G0 A3 e0 → A3 G0 A3 B3 → A3 G0 A3 B1
lh: 3 - 3 - | 3 - 3 4 | 3 - 3 1
rh: p i p a | p i p m | p i p m
used: Verse/Chorus part 2, Bridge, Outro
@endfingering

@fingering Am — part 1
notes: A0 G2 A0 B1
lh: - 3 - 1
rh: p i p m
used: Intro, Verse/Chorus part 1, Bridge opening
@endfingering

@fingering Am — part 2
notes: A0 G2 A0 e0 → A0 G2 A0 B3 → A0 G2 A0 B1
lh: - 3 - - | - 3 - 4 | - 3 - 1
rh: p i p a | p i p m | p i p m
used: Verse/Chorus part 2, Bridge, Outro
@endfingering

@fingering G — part 1
notes: E3 G0 E3 B0
lh: 3 - 3 -
rh: p i p m
used: Intro, Verse/Chorus part 1
@endfingering

@fingering G — part 2
notes: E3 G0 E3 B3 → E3 G0 E3 B1 → E3 G0 E3 B0
lh: 3 - 3 4 | 3 - 3 1 | 3 - 3 -
rh: p i p m | p i p m | p i p m
used: Verse/Chorus part 2, Bridge, Outro
@endfingering

@fingering Em
notes: E0 G0 E0 G0
lh: - - - -
rh: p i p i
used: All parts after G
@endfingering

@fingering F
notes: E1 G2 E1 B1 → E1 G2 E1 G2
lh: 1 3 1 2 | 1 3 1 3
rh: p i p m | p i p i
used: Intro, Verse/Chorus, Bridge, Outro
@endfingering

